msgid "Оси и многомерные данные"
msgstr "Axes and multidimensional data"

msgid "Аргумент ``axis`` задаёт измерение, вдоль которого метрика сворачивает значения; остальные измерения сохраняются. С ``axis=None`` все значения объединяются в один ряд. На xarray вместо номера оси используется имя измерения, аргумент ``dim``."
msgstr "The argument ``axis`` sets the dimension along which the metric collapses values; the other dimensions are kept. With ``axis=None`` all values are pooled into one series. On xarray a dimension name is used instead of the axis number, the argument ``dim``."

msgid "Форма результата"
msgstr "Shape of the result"

msgid "Данные трёх створов, форма ``(время, створ)``, и поле расходов, форма ``(время, широта, долгота)``. Таблица ниже получена запуском; ``reduction`` не задан."
msgstr "Data of three gauges, shape ``(time, gauge)``, and a discharge field, shape ``(time, lat, lon)``. The table below is from a real run; ``reduction`` is not set."

msgid ""
"import numpy as np\n"
"import hydrometrics as hm\n"
"\n"
"rng = np.random.default_rng(42)\n"
"dates = np.arange(\"2010-10-01\", \"2013-10-01\", dtype=\"datetime64[D]\")\n"
"doy = (dates - dates.astype(\"datetime64[Y]\")).astype(int)\n"
"# Половодье в конце апреля поверх зимней и летней межени, м³/с\n"
"q_obs = 12 + 240 * np.exp(-(((doy - 118) / 16.0) ** 2)) + rng.gamma(2.0, 2.5, doy.size)\n"
"# Модель запаздывает на двое суток и срезает пик\n"
"q_sim = np.clip(0.88 * np.roll(q_obs, 2) + 3 + rng.normal(0, 5, doy.size), 0.1, None)"
msgstr ""
"import numpy as np\n"
"import hydrometrics as hm\n"
"\n"
"rng = np.random.default_rng(42)\n"
"dates = np.arange(\"2010-10-01\", \"2013-10-01\", dtype=\"datetime64[D]\")\n"
"doy = (dates - dates.astype(\"datetime64[Y]\")).astype(int)\n"
"# Spring flood in late April on top of winter and summer low flow, m³/s\n"
"q_obs = 12 + 240 * np.exp(-(((doy - 118) / 16.0) ** 2)) + rng.gamma(2.0, 2.5, doy.size)\n"
"# The model lags by two days and clips the peak\n"
"q_sim = np.clip(0.88 * np.roll(q_obs, 2) + 3 + rng.normal(0, 5, doy.size), 0.1, None)"

msgid ""
"# Три створа: столбцы массива (время, створ)\n"
"q_obs_st = np.column_stack([q_obs, 0.4 * q_obs + 2, 1.7 * q_obs + 5])\n"
"q_sim_st = np.column_stack([q_sim, 0.35 * q_sim + 4, 1.9 * q_sim])"
msgstr ""
"# Three gauges: columns of a (time, gauge) array\n"
"q_obs_st = np.column_stack([q_obs, 0.4 * q_obs + 2, 1.7 * q_obs + 5])\n"
"q_sim_st = np.column_stack([q_sim, 0.35 * q_sim + 4, 1.9 * q_sim])"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"field_obs = q_obs[:, None, None] * np.array([[1.0, 0.5], [2.0, 1.5]])\n"
"field_sim = q_sim[:, None, None] * np.array([[1.0, 0.5], [2.0, 1.5]])\n"
"\n"
"calls = {\n"
"    \"(time, gauge), axis=None\": hm.nse(q_obs_st, q_sim_st),\n"
"    \"(time, gauge), axis=0\": hm.nse(q_obs_st, q_sim_st, axis=0),\n"
"    \"(time, gauge), axis=1\": hm.nse(q_obs_st, q_sim_st, axis=1),\n"
"    \"(time, gauge), axis=0, reduction='mean'\": hm.nse(q_obs_st, q_sim_st, axis=0, reduction=\"mean\"),\n"
"    \"(time, lat, lon), axis=0\": hm.nse(field_obs, field_sim, axis=0),\n"
"}\n"
"for label, result in calls.items():\n"
"    print(f\"{label:42s} {np.shape(result.value)}\")"
msgstr ""
"field_obs = q_obs[:, None, None] * np.array([[1.0, 0.5], [2.0, 1.5]])\n"
"field_sim = q_sim[:, None, None] * np.array([[1.0, 0.5], [2.0, 1.5]])\n"
"\n"
"calls = {\n"
"    \"(time, gauge), axis=None\": hm.nse(q_obs_st, q_sim_st),\n"
"    \"(time, gauge), axis=0\": hm.nse(q_obs_st, q_sim_st, axis=0),\n"
"    \"(time, gauge), axis=1\": hm.nse(q_obs_st, q_sim_st, axis=1),\n"
"    \"(time, gauge), axis=0, reduction='mean'\": hm.nse(q_obs_st, q_sim_st, axis=0, reduction=\"mean\"),\n"
"    \"(time, lat, lon), axis=0\": hm.nse(field_obs, field_sim, axis=0),\n"
"}\n"
"for label, result in calls.items():\n"
"    print(f\"{label:42s} {np.shape(result.value)}\")"

msgid ""
"(time, gauge), axis=None                   ()\n"
"(time, gauge), axis=0                      (3,)\n"
"(time, gauge), axis=1                      (1096,)\n"
"(time, gauge), axis=0, reduction='mean'    ()\n"
"(time, lat, lon), axis=0                   (2, 2)"
msgstr ""
"(time, gauge), axis=None                   ()\n"
"(time, gauge), axis=0                      (3,)\n"
"(time, gauge), axis=1                      (1096,)\n"
"(time, gauge), axis=0, reduction='mean'    ()\n"
"(time, lat, lon), axis=0                   (2, 2)"

msgid "Умолчание для ``reduction`` зависит от оси: при заданной оси возвращается массив по оставшимся измерениям (как ``\"none\"``), без оси результат это одно число (как ``\"mean\"``). Явный ``reduction=\"mean\"`` сворачивает массив в число и среднее считается по значениям срезов, а не по всем элементам сразу. Для метрик со словарём результата, как :func:`~hydrometrics.kge_components`, правило применяется к каждому значению."
msgstr "The default for ``reduction`` depends on the axis: with an axis an array over the remaining dimensions is returned (like ``\"none\"``), without an axis the result is a single number (like ``\"mean\"``). An explicit ``reduction=\"mean\"`` collapses the array to a number and the mean is taken over the slice values, not over all elements at once. For metrics with a dictionary result, such as :func:`~hydrometrics.kge_components`, the rule applies to each value."

msgid "xarray: имена измерений и координаты"
msgstr "xarray: dimension names and coordinates"

msgid "На ``DataArray`` ось задаётся именем, а координаты оставшихся измерений сохраняются. Несколько измерений можно свернуть сразу:"
msgstr "On a ``DataArray`` the axis is given by name and the coordinates of the remaining dimensions are kept. Several dimensions can be collapsed at once:"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"import xarray as xr\n"
"\n"
"coords = {\"time\": dates, \"lat\": [55.0, 56.0], \"lon\": [37.0, 38.0]}\n"
"obs_da = xr.DataArray(field_obs, dims=[\"time\", \"lat\", \"lon\"], coords=coords)\n"
"sim_da = xr.DataArray(field_sim, dims=[\"time\", \"lat\", \"lon\"], coords=coords)\n"
"per_cell = hm.nse(obs_da, sim_da, dim=\"time\").value\n"
"print(per_cell.dims, per_cell.shape)\n"
"overall = hm.nse(obs_da, sim_da, dim=[\"time\", \"lat\", \"lon\"]).value\n"
"print(overall.dims, round(float(overall), 4))"
msgstr ""
"import xarray as xr\n"
"\n"
"coords = {\"time\": dates, \"lat\": [55.0, 56.0], \"lon\": [37.0, 38.0]}\n"
"obs_da = xr.DataArray(field_obs, dims=[\"time\", \"lat\", \"lon\"], coords=coords)\n"
"sim_da = xr.DataArray(field_sim, dims=[\"time\", \"lat\", \"lon\"], coords=coords)\n"
"per_cell = hm.nse(obs_da, sim_da, dim=\"time\").value\n"
"print(per_cell.dims, per_cell.shape)\n"
"overall = hm.nse(obs_da, sim_da, dim=[\"time\", \"lat\", \"lon\"]).value\n"
"print(overall.dims, round(float(overall), 4))"

msgid ""
"('lat', 'lon') (2, 2)\n"
"() 0.957"
msgstr ""
"('lat', 'lon') (2, 2)\n"
"() 0.957"

msgid "Одновременная передача ``dim`` и ``axis`` вызывает ``TypeError``. Координаты xarray проверяются параметром ``align`` (см. :doc:`input_data`)."
msgstr "Passing ``dim`` and ``axis`` together raises ``TypeError``. The xarray coordinates are checked by the parameter ``align`` (see :doc:`input_data`)."

msgid "Ансамбли"
msgstr "Ensembles"

msgid "Метрики для ансамблей, :func:`~hydrometrics.crps` и производные, ожидают члены ансамбля на последней оси: ``obs`` формы ``(n,)``, ``sim`` формы ``(n, m)``. Если члены стоят на первой оси, как в ``(член, время)``, её нужно переставить:"
msgstr "Ensemble metrics, :func:`~hydrometrics.crps` and its derivatives, expect the ensemble members on the last axis: ``obs`` of shape ``(n,)``, ``sim`` of shape ``(n, m)``. If the members stand on the first axis, as in ``(member, time)``, it must be moved:"

msgid ""
"ens_rng = np.random.default_rng(7)\n"
"members = 1.05 * q_obs[:, None] + ens_rng.normal(0, 1, (q_obs.size, 20)) * (2 + 0.15 * q_obs[:, None])\n"
"member_first = members.T  # shape (member, time)\n"
"print(member_first.shape)\n"
"print(round(float(hm.crps(q_obs, np.moveaxis(member_first, 0, -1))), 4), round(float(hm.crps(q_obs, members)), 4))"
msgstr ""
"ens_rng = np.random.default_rng(7)\n"
"members = 1.05 * q_obs[:, None] + ens_rng.normal(0, 1, (q_obs.size, 20)) * (2 + 0.15 * q_obs[:, None])\n"
"member_first = members.T  # shape (member, time)\n"
"print(member_first.shape)\n"
"print(round(float(hm.crps(q_obs, np.moveaxis(member_first, 0, -1))), 4), round(float(hm.crps(q_obs, members)), 4))"

msgid ""
"(20, 1096)\n"
"2.06 2.06"
msgstr ""
"(20, 1096)\n"
"2.06 2.06"

msgid "Для ансамбля ось ``axis`` применяется к измерениям ``obs``, а не к члену ансамбля. Пример по створам: ``obs`` формы ``(n, g)``, ``sim`` формы ``(n, g, m)`` и ``axis=0`` дают значение для каждого створа."
msgstr "For an ensemble ``axis`` applies to the dimensions of ``obs``, not to the ensemble member. By gauge: ``obs`` of shape ``(n, g)``, ``sim`` of shape ``(n, g, m)`` and ``axis=0`` give a value for each gauge."

msgid ""
"members_st = np.stack([members, 0.5 * members, 1.5 * members], axis=1)\n"
"print(members_st.shape)\n"
"print(np.round(hm.crps(q_obs_st, members_st, axis=0).value, 3))"
msgstr ""
"members_st = np.stack([members, 0.5 * members, 1.5 * members], axis=1)\n"
"print(members_st.shape)\n"
"print(np.round(hm.crps(q_obs_st, members_st, axis=0).value, 3))"

msgid ""
"(1096, 3, 20)\n"
"[2.06  2.042 6.14 ]"
msgstr ""
"(1096, 3, 20)\n"
"[2.06  2.042 6.14 ]"

msgid "Метрики без расчёта по оси"
msgstr "Metrics without an axis"

msgid "Четыре метрики задаются групповыми массивами, и ось для них не определена: любое значение ``axis`` кроме ``None`` вызывает ``NotImplementedError``. Это :func:`~hydrometrics.ssigma_delta`, :func:`~hydrometrics.forecast_verification_delta`, :func:`~hydrometrics.regNSE` и :func:`~hydrometrics.nse_variance_weighted`. Ряды разных створов для них считают в цикле по створам."
msgstr "Four metrics are defined through group arrays and an axis is undefined for them: any value of ``axis`` other than ``None`` raises ``NotImplementedError``. These are :func:`~hydrometrics.ssigma_delta`, :func:`~hydrometrics.forecast_verification_delta`, :func:`~hydrometrics.regNSE` and :func:`~hydrometrics.nse_variance_weighted`. The series of different gauges are computed for them in a loop over gauges."

msgid ""
"try:\n"
"    hm.regNSE(q_obs_st, q_sim_st, dates=dates, axis=0)\n"
"except NotImplementedError as exc:\n"
"    print(exc)"
msgstr ""
"try:\n"
"    hm.regNSE(q_obs_st, q_sim_st, dates=dates, axis=0)\n"
"except NotImplementedError as exc:\n"
"    print(exc)"

msgid "regNSE does not support axis (it is not defined along an axis)"
msgstr "regNSE does not support axis (it is not defined along an axis)"

msgid "Ранговые метрики, :func:`~hydrometrics.spearman_r` и :func:`~hydrometrics.kendall_tau`, ось поддерживают, но считают каждый срез отдельно в цикле, поэтому на больших массивах медленнее остальных."
msgstr "The rank metrics, :func:`~hydrometrics.spearman_r` and :func:`~hydrometrics.kendall_tau`, support an axis but compute each slice separately in a loop, so on large arrays they are slower than the others."

msgid "Если вес задан, его форма должна совпадать с формой ``obs``; иначе ``ValueError``."
msgstr "If a weight is given its shape must equal that of ``obs``; otherwise ``ValueError``."

